	Daisuke (Cursed Singing Lech)
		"This -- this is totally cramping my style! I have to find that old bag fast!"
		A shallow celebrity singer cursed to transform into a rabbit at a woman's romantic touch.
		Background
			A wealthy, womanizing pop idol, Daisuke rudely dismissed an elderly fan who asked for an autograph -- and she cursed him on the spot. Now any woman's amorous touch turns him into a handsome black rabbit until he escapes her sight, clothes and all left behind. Chastened but hardly reformed, he's determined to track the old woman down and get the curse lifted.
		Personality
			Lecherous, self-absorbed, and far too famous for his own good, Daisuke's biggest problems are entirely of his own making -- when he isn't chasing girls, he's complaining about his food.
		Abilities
			Agile +2
			Attack (Kung Faux) +1
			Beautiful +2
			Combat Expert +1
			Famous +3
			Knowledge (Motorcycles) +2
			Performer +3
			Quick +1
			Vigorous +1
			Wealthy +3
		Weaknesses
			Accidental Transformation (Black Bunny) −3
			Impulsive −1
			Lecherous −2
			Love Interest (Himself) −1
			Love Magnet −3
			Overconfident −1
			Quirk (Odd Food Demands) −1
			Rude −1
			Weak-Willed −1
		Combat
			Health: 40 | Endurance: 50 | Defense: 3 | Threat Value (TV): 11
			Attacks
				Crouching Rabbit, Hidden Bunny: Roll 5 dice | DX 2 | Endurance Cost: 0 (Affinity: Martial Arts). Daisuke's fondness for martial arts movies has led to spending megabucks on tutors.
				This Axe Goes to 11!: Roll 5 dice | DX 5 | Endurance Cost: 0 (Perks: Effective x3; Flaws: Ammunition x3). In desperation, Daisuke can sacrifice his guitar to save his hide…
		Notes
			Black Bunny! -- While transformed, Daisuke loses nearly all his Abilities but gains Quick +2 and Awkward Size -2. He reverts to human form once he's out of the sight of the woman who triggered the change -- his clothes, unfortunately, do not come with him.
		Fluff
			Concept: Cursed Singing Lech, Birthday: August 7, Age: 24, Gender: Male, Height: 5'9", Weight: 146 lbs., Hair: Black, Eyes: Red, Association: Soh-nii Records, Hobbies: Chasing Girls, Favorite Food: Chicken and Waffles (…and Glazed Carrots), Allies: He, Himself, and Him, Enemies: A Mean Ol' Bag.
